      "id": "4b366057-239e-4036-b3ce-3f745719500e",
      "text": "\"Now\" and \"next\" are first-person notions, the order of an observer's own states, and are not tied to any external time or clock. Time evolution of a state is a correlation of probabilities with some clock variable.",
